| Sustained practical, advanced, and independent investigation | [Complete the substantial book, lecture, and analytical-method reading](research/A-sustained-mineralogy-and-petrology-programme.lingua#r_0CW5J4TVZGG1T3K1JE8ZZ2412X) · [Demonstrate specimen, microscope, and analytical-observation competence](research/Sustained-specimen-and-microscope-laboratory-study.lingua#r_32GJMXG5AZ5WT3PCQHY77G2WB0) · [Characterize a material by independent structural, optical, and chemical evidence](research/Integrated-crystal-and-analytical-characterization.lingua#r_5C4Q9327N8YT8SAN6Q8F2SJF1P) · [Defend an igneous history using phase relations, material balance, and independent evidence](research/Advanced-igneous-process-and-experimental-study.lingua#r_6TQ5TWWMJ8WZWXWBJTABAY0CQK) · [Reconstruct a sedimentary rock from sources through burial and alteration](research/Advanced-sedimentary-provenance-and-diagenetic-study.lingua#r_21K256CCMWD35R663MPV64NG88) · [Defend a metamorphic history with domain, phase, and chronological tests](research/Advanced-metamorphic-model-and-petrochronology-study.lingua#r_7P5KPCH145YG8XYV124C723F73) · [Build a mineralogical handoff from geological material to a production requirement](research/An-advanced-mineral-to-feedstock-study.lingua#r_0DWP2N35XZ7YJN6DEXCGMA5T0X) · [Conduct an independent mineralogical or petrological investigation](research/Independent-mineralogical-and-petrological-scholarship.lingua#r_2RWA3AAGE5KFVA8P379Q76X8XQ) · [Demonstrate integrated mineral, method, process, and research understanding](research/Completion-and-specialist-continuations.lingua#r_63VQA6WVZ91KKYDQD43BYDFXRK) |

Eight shared Records keep their existing routes and add distinct mineralogy/petrology continuations: [Identify a mineral through converging properties and context](../geology/materials/Mineral-identification-and-evidence.lingua#r_4V80T5SEAWK0JPVQTJ29YSH6F4), [Connect crystal structure, defects, and composition with material properties](../../../hephaestus/chemistry/general-chemistry/states/Crystals-disorder-and-material-properties.lingua#r_2D2PGMBBES807ABNV8V0A46JZA), [Read a rock’s texture, structure, composition, and alteration together](../geology/materials/Textures-structures-and-rock-classification.lingua#r_6YHWHD1G11JAT700N6FVMHVP5N), [Chemical measurements — matrix, recovery, selectivity, and reference material](../../../hephaestus/inquiry/metrology/applications/Chemical-and-reference-material-measurements.lingua#r_78FAVM8QZ3F7N4DQP2DDP1R7KQ), [Interpret vapor pressure, phase change, and a phase diagram](../../../hephaestus/chemistry/general-chemistry/states/Phase-changes-and-equilibrium-maps.lingua#r_7XXDG9YQTWEGSDFX1HXPBTGY8S), [Build a numerical validation argument across several kinds of evidence](../../../hephaestus/inquiry/reproducible-computation/numerics/A-numerical-validation-study.lingua#r_7EY9S6DXHFHSJAGA30W35A4ZD8), [Explain igneous materials through melting, crystallization, and field relations](../geology/materials/Melting-crystallization-and-igneous-bodies.lingua#r_7QWRZH8D2EVJR6F20Z77Y4QXR7), and [Infer metamorphic history from reactions, fabrics, and context](../geology/materials/Metamorphism-protolith-and-pressure-temperature-history.lingua#r_3P42J3NDC118QXFD1G1ME5SGTG). Select both endpoints of `#mineralogy-and-petrology` assertions to follow this subject. Source references and other predicates retain their own meaning; ordinary Protein selection suffices without another Trail feature or saved view directory.

[Mineralogy and petrology sources — books, laboratories, analytical methods, and research](Sources.lingua#r_38Q6Z3J7ER2G1B441JXJ14NV5A) identifies complete works, authorized links, editions, rights, and access limits. Books, articles, media, structures, spectra, and external datasets remain external. The two small inline programs and connecting explanations are original teaching material, with explicit limited models rather than a promise of general mineral identification or petrological simulation.

[Demonstrate integrated mineral, method, process, and research understanding](research/Completion-and-specialist-continuations.lingua#r_63VQA6WVZ91KKYDQD43BYDFXRK) requires sustained practical and academic work, independent checks, alternative interpretations, and scholarship. A virtual or supplied-data study has value within its stated scope; it does not itself establish actual field, instrument, or experimental competence.

Continue through [Earth — materials, processes, and geological history](../Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH), [Geology — Earth materials, processes, history, and investigation](../geology/Geology.lingua#r_3CK43VQS79NK0STWNPSCS8YM06), and [Nature — Earth, living systems, and their relationships](../../Nature.lingua#r_5DAMNRQZX9M2PRPHVJB673XX21) for the wider natural history, [Chemistry — substances, transformations, and evidence](../../../hephaestus/chemistry/Chemistry.lingua#r_2NWJY1HCKPBM4T6YQSDHN8S3S0) and [Ergon — mathematics, science, and engineering](../../../hephaestus/Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) for related science/methods, and [Hephaestus](../../../hephaestus/Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) for extraction, materials, manufacturing, and maintenance. Questions about explanation and evidence return to [Philosophy](../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001). The unique later geochemistry, economic-geology, mining, processing, and materials work remains its own depth, reusing these foundations.

**Continue:** [Read from a first specimen through substantial books and advanced studies](foundations/Reading-minerals-and-rocks-from-zero.lingua#r_57NZD8HAVKQW409DEN9D771VK5).
} r_44F7X6GPMW6ZSCCN6D71QSVKBN

